  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Always supports stream access and URL access, but only allows\n<code>java.io.File</code> access when the web application archive\nis expanded.",
      "translation": "始终支持流访问和 URL 访问，但仅当 Web 应用程序归档已展开时，才允许 `<code>java.io.File</code>` 访问。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The Servlet spec requires that resource paths start with a slash,\neven if many containers accept paths without leading slash too.\nConsequently, the given path will be prepended with a slash if it\ndoesn't already start with one.",
      "translation": "Servlet 规范规定资源路径必须以斜杠开头，即使许多容器也接受不带前导斜杠的路径。因此，如果给定路径尚未以斜杠开头，将为其添加一个前导斜杠。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../../../core/io/AbstractResource.html#isFile()\">AbstractResource</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从类复制：<code><a href=\"../../../core/io/AbstractResource.html#isFile()\">AbstractResource</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../core/io/ContextResource.html#getPathWithinContext()\">ContextResource</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../core/io/ContextResource.html#getPathWithinContext()\">ContextResource</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation delegates to <code>ServletContext.getResourceAsStream</code>,\nwhich returns <code>null</code> in case of a non-readable resource (for example, a directory).",
      "translation": "此实现委托给 `<code>ServletContext.getResourceAsStream</code>`，在资源不可读（例如目录）的情况下返回 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation checks <code>ServletContext.getResource</code>.",
      "translation": "此实现检查 `ServletContext.getResource`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation resolves \"file:\" URLs or alternatively delegates to\n<code>ServletContext.getRealPath</code>, throwing a FileNotFoundException\nif not found or not resolvable.",
      "translation": "此实现会解析\"file:\" URL，或者委托给 <code>ServletContext.getRealPath</code>；如果未找到或无法解析，则抛出 FileNotFoundException。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation delegates to <code>ServletContext.getResourceAsStream</code>,\nbut throws a FileNotFoundException if no resource found.",
      "translation": "此实现委托给 `<code>ServletContext.getResourceAsStream</code>`，但如果未找到资源，则抛出 `FileNotFoundException`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation delegates to <code>ServletContext.getResource</code>,\nbut throws a FileNotFoundException if no resource found.",
      "translation": "此实现委托给 `<code>ServletContext.getResource</code>`，但如果未找到资源，则抛出 `FileNotFoundException`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation always returns <code>false</code>.",
      "translation": "此实现始终返回<code>false</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation creates a ServletContextResource, applying the given path\nrelative to the path of the underlying file of this resource descriptor.",
      "translation": "此实现会创建一个 ServletContextResource，并将给定的路径相对于该资源描述符底层文件的路径进行应用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation compares the underlying ServletContext resource locations.",
      "translation": "此实现比较底层 ServletContext 资源位置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation returns a description that includes the ServletContext\nresource location.",
      "translation": "该实现返回一个包含 ServletContext 资源位置的描述。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation returns the name of the file that this ServletContext\nresource refers to.",
      "translation": "此实现返回该 ServletContext 资源所引用的文件名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the path for this resource.",
      "translation": "返回该资源的路径。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the ServletContext for this resource.",
      "translation": "返回此资源的 ServletContext。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation returns the hash code of the underlying\nServletContext resource location.",
      "translation": "此实现返回底层 ServletContext 资源位置的哈希码。",
      "count": 2
    },
